- Exact container lineage is checked first: a registered packet whose rows vector is `identical?` to the candidate's wins. Host decomposition (`first`/`rest`) hands that very vector object to reassembly, so this match is occurrence-specific. In the repro, reassembling `b` now recovers `b`'s own entry — the feed-expansion origin — instead of `a`'s.
